Package: tidymail
Title: A Tidy, Backend-Independent Interface for Email
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ousmane", "Ouedraogo", , "oousmane@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6349-4146"))
Description: Email as data in R. Messages are built with 'build_msg()' and
    sent with 'send_mail()' over SMTP using 'blastula'. Mailboxes are read
    with 'fetch_mail()' over IMAP using 'mRpostman' and returned as tibbles
    that can be filtered, arranged and mutated like any data frame.
    Attachments are listed in the result and saved with
    'download_attachments()'. Passwords are kept in the system keychain or
    read from environment variables, never stored in the objects.
